+# Hollow House exterior — contractor delivery
+
+For Claude. Read [handover43](../../handovers/43-hollow-house-exterior.md). Sourcebranch: `contractor/hollow-house-exterior`; base: `3f92ca8df92e07b09445ce092101e9309c00288c`.
+
+This adds seven exteriorstages, generatedupgrade icons, subtle hauntanimations and a directlytappable foyerdoor. It preserves the existing rules/saves, footprint, visitorpaths, foyer, maze, hayride and privateestate.
+
+The normal fullgame HTML is published separately, with noQA funds/unlocks. The sourcebranch is reviewable; the downloadsbranch is artifacts only and must not be merged. See [verification](verification/README.md) for exactbuild hashes, testedflows and browserpolicy limitations.
