+# Historical first exterior run
+
+HTML SHA-256: `3746b39255a19d454ab0da99ae174de58d8f595f65e9bbff29379341fc633d10`. This build predates the narrower attraction sign and the forward-hinged shutters.
+
+28 assertions passed before the immediate reduced-motion assertion failed. The harness had assumed a media change was observable after one render frame; the final harness instead waits for both the real media query and the controller event state. This report remains `passed:false` and is not final approval. No runtime fix was made on the strength of this timing assumption alone.
+
+The successful scope includes real purchase/restoration, all four paid upgrades, facade/context picking, direct highlighted-door foyer entry with no ticket charge, distinct native stage geometry, unchanged saved data during animation and cached refreshes. Its stage screenshots are historical visual evidence. Read `../final/` for current-build results.
