+# Final exterior polish review
+
+Exact HTML SHA-256: `4e84fd080a749e129020da081afdc064cdc29328678c208210e72a4111cccbf5`.
+
+**10/10 focused checks pass**, with zero page/console errors, zero external asset requests and one canvas. This final build changes only the dormer height relative to the fully tested 151fc00 build; the paired node tests verify their glass stays in front of the roof.
+
+The wider desktop camera shows the derelict house, clock-tower tier three and crowned twin-spire tier five with room below the HUD. All three upper warm glass panes now read on the grand mansion. The narrower sign preserves a readable title while revealing the window arches and gargoyles. Shutters, glowing entrance, cobwebs, pumpkins and side markers remain coherent with the farm; the existing approach path stays clear.
+
+The phone upgrade menu fits with generated stage icons and 44px controls. The Fold screenshot shows the complete mansion without a menu. The actual visible door still enters the existing foyer; returning to the farm preserves the entire paused save and ticket ledgers.
+
+The separate `../final/` report supplies 46 complete functional/visual checks on 151fc00: real costs/restoration/upgrades, media preference changes, caching, responsive menus and save/reload. Current images supersede its close, partially clipped framing and buried dormer glass.
+
+This is screenshot and layout verification under managed Chromium/SwiftShader, performance quality/DPR1. It does not establish physical-device frame rate, direct file navigation or native fullscreen support.
